WEBVTT

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.770
The controls aren't working!

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.400
We're being washed away!

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:12.740
This is the rift between dimensions...

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:15.930
I can hear the moaning of twisted space.

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:18.240
It's the dissonance of despair.

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.300
It's only a matter of time before we're...

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.250
Shrade!

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.050
We have to Unite again!

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.930
We can't! Your body can't take it!

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:44.440
Once we Unite, I'll be able to hear the scale that the dimensions play on.

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.300
Shrade!

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.040
Let the flow carry you!

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:51.630
Harmonize with the sounds around you!

00:00:58.470 --> 00:01:01.380
Can you feel it, my friend?

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.500
This will be my last Union.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.580
Resounding Union!

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.090
Go, Aquarion!

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.560
Is everyone here?

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:28.690
We have something very important to tell you.

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:36.450
This is a story of 12,000 years ago,

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:41.990
and of another 12,000 years before that.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:44.500
An eternal saga.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.250
This is ridiculous!

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:50.780
We don't have time to listen to stories when we could be helping Amata-

00:01:57.470 --> 00:01:58.470
What?

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:00.970
What's going on?

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:07.750
We're on top of a book!

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:11.360
This book has always been with you.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.340
It has come to us from ages past,
yet it has never moved.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.570
It is called the Book of Twin Stars.

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:22.490
And now, at long last...

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:26.580
it shall be opened!

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:39.940
The story begins 24,000 long years ago.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:51.340
These visions are more lifelike than my Prophecies of Despair!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:13.050
Let this sword be like a tuning fork...

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:16.340
and its resonance point me to the exit...

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.850
What are those images?

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:31.320
The tuning fork is calling out the memories etched into the dimensions...

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.640
Shrade!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.110
Keep watching!

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:50.910
The Dark Angels were humanity's great enemies.

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:56.420
They brought immeasurable
destruction and took innumerable lives.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.920
The footsteps of doom were approaching...

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:05.800
and they belonged to Apollonius, the Angel of Slaughter.

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:15.690
But by some strange trick of fate, he found love.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:26.740
Apollonius fell in love with a human woman, Celiane, though she was his enemy.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:30.750
That's...

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.750
The Legendary Aquarion!

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:39.220
Apollonius piloted a Machine Angel to drive away the Dark Angels

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:42.670
and protect Celiane and her world.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:47.410
But for every light, there is a shadow.

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:51.520
Apollonius' betrothed, the Dark Angel Toma,

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:57.020
still loved him, but also hated him for his betrayal.

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:00.580
And there was another.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:04.720
A small one who sought light from the shadows.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:06.730
A dog?

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:08.030
It's adorable!

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:13.120
This was the Winged Hound Pollon, Apollonius' companion.

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:21.050
He bore an unrequited love for Celiane, who loved his master.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:26.530
The sorrowful Pollon made a wish to the night.

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:30.830
"If we were to be reborn, may Celiane and I be reunited."

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:40.420
Many emotions, including Toma's hatred and Pollon's wishes, remained as time flowed on.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:44.800
The void left by the dead, and the sorrow felt by the living.

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.980
Joy in the shadows, and madness in the light.

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:51.580
Let us bring them all together,

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.500
and wrap them up with beautiful lace.

00:05:55.910 --> 00:06:00.150
The noon sun is life, and the nighttime moon is death.

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:03.780
They blur together, until...

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:07.010
Listen closely!

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:10.470
The second chapter is beginning.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:17.150
These visions again!

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:18.850
They're the same ones we saw before.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:23.690
The Dark Angels returned from their long absence,

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:27.240
and plagued humanity once more.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:33.130
But humanity still remembered the legend of their salvation.

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:35.620
High Commander?

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:38.120
Why is High Commander Fudo there?

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:41.380
I thought this all happened 12,000 years ago!

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:48.840
Watch closely! This is the very crux of the legend!

00:06:55.010 --> 00:07:00.480
The humans followed their legends, unearthed the Machine Angel,

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.030
and used it to fight back.

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:08.570
In Apollonius' place, Aquarion had a new pilot:

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:11.010
a boy named Apollo.

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:13.440
Of course! He was Apollonius!

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:15.130
So he was his reincarnation...

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:17.140
No.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.580
He was actually the reincarnation of...

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:33.720
Kagura! Taking the true Eve for yourself is an act of outright treason!

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:38.060
You no longer have the right to call yourself a citizen of Altair!

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:42.870
Damn it!

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.320
I won't let anyone have Silvie!

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:54.860
Forgive me, Apollo...

00:07:56.080 --> 00:08:01.580
Apollo was the reincarnation of the Winged Hound Pollon.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.150
Apollon from the legend...

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:05.840
is the reincarnation of a winged dog?

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:11.810
His love, Celiane, was reincarnated as Silvia.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:15.440
The two were brought together by a twist of fate,

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:18.370
and an attraction formed between them on the battlefield.

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:23.100
But fate can also be cruel.

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:30.470
For the Dark Angel Toma was also reborn into that age.

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:35.240
Toma still bore love and hatred for Apollonius,

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:39.470
and he schemed to destroy the humanity that Apollonius fought for.

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:45.580
But his twisted love brought about the destruction of his own kind.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:50.840
The Tree of Life meant to restore the Dark Angels

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:56.840
did not bear fruit, but withered and fell back into the earth.

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:04.560
Let's meet again in 12,000 years.

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.100
Apollo!

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.330
Come, my friends!

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:11.860
Let human and Angel join hands...

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:14.530
and forge a new Genesis for this world!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.160
The poor Winged Hound, Pollon.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.290
For before his love of 12,000 years could be realized,

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:29.430
he would have to be separated once again.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:33.380
That was the day the world began.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:49.770
Here, the legend leapt forward another 12,000 years,

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.150
into the third chapter.

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:52.780
The third chapter?

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:53.860
Does that mean...?

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:54.990
Precisely.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:58.540
The third chapter takes place now.

00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:10.960
The world split!

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:15.930
When the Tree of Life withered, the world fell out of balance,

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:18.470
and the planet was divided in two.

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:23.080
Dark and light. Positive and negative. Male and female.

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:25.310
Two opposite worlds.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:31.730
The two lover stars separated by the Milky Way: Vega and Altair.

00:10:34.910 --> 00:10:40.870
The Earth, and the other Earth beyond the Dimension Gate.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:43.490
Our Earth...

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.080
...and its opposite world...

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:47.620
They were originally one?

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:50.480
Perhaps it was God playing dice,

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:53.060
or perhaps some form of quantum entanglement.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:57.970
The two worlds' fates were linked, despite their separation.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:02.220
Two worlds that are fragments. Two souls ripped away from one another.

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:08.230
This is the story written in the Book of Twin Stars.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:18.160
Their world wants ours, in the same way I wanted Amata.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:21.270
Two worlds bound by fate...

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:24.480
Shrade!

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:25.530
I'm all right.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.300
In fact, I feel good.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.580
I think I can almost hear it.

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.650
The final melody I've been searching for.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:39.800
The two worlds that long for one another sing two melodies.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:42.560
They're both lonely...

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:45.150
Just like me.

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:47.970
Shrade is lonely?

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:50.160
That's why they're trying to reach each other.

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:54.060
They want to fill the gaps in each others' hearts...

00:11:55.750 --> 00:12:01.470
Over the eons, Pollon became Apollo, and then a new form.

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:06.580
He was born to a songstress of Vega, Alicia.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:09.040
However!

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:15.960
Another had reached this age first.

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:19.710
Carrying all his memories from all the ages.

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:21.280
Donar!

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:23.220
This pain...

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:26.700
Apollo was never Apollonius.

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:30.560
He lied to me.

00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:35.400
I must have revenge...

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:38.230
I must have my revenge!

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:46.990
He divided the soul of Alicia's child in two, plotting to use it to take his revenge.

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:50.040
Amata, is that...?

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.680
And though Apollo's soul was so divided,

00:12:54.680 --> 00:13:01.670
the part of his beloved Celiane that became Silvia was reborn into just one life.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.920
Would that be...?

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:07.810
The one who has inherited Silvia's soul...

00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:09.050
She is...

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:18.060
Mikono!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.190
Zessica?

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:29.430
Amata really is part of Apollo's soul.

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:34.450
That makes me the intruder.

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:38.750
A world divided into two worlds.

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:42.570
Apollo's soul divided into two lives.

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:45.540
It is a legend of tragedy.

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:48.750
This tragedy has a director.

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:56.100
A soul haunted by his terribly deep love for 24,000 years.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:59.620
The darkness from the soul that was once Toma.

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:01.360
In this age, his name is...

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.070
Mikage.

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:08.070
If there is hope for a bright end to this tragic legend,

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.820
it lies with you alone!

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:15.750
That is all I can tell you.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.000
Wait!

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:20.980
Isn't the next part written in the Book of Twin Stars?

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:24.940
The end to this war! Something even my Prophecy can't see!

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.410
I will show you.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:34.390
What?

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:37.390
It's blank!

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:42.700
You must write the rest of the pages yourself!

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:07.590
It's you...

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.900
You're finally awake.

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:12.180
I was getting worried.

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:16.850
What's up? You hurt?

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.020
No...

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.960
Then why are you crying?

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:25.450
I can finally say I'm sorry.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:32.380
I'm sorry I never realized how you felt.

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.420
I'm truly sorry.

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.980
I've found it at last.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:51.310
It took far too long...

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:54.130
but the scales the two worlds play on have come together,

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:56.310
and they exude a brilliant white radiance.

00:15:56.880 --> 00:16:05.020
Is it a void in their hearts... or a new world altogether?

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:07.430
Like a pure white score of music...

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:14.910
Listen...

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.080
Shrade!

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.460
This melody!

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:34.130
This is my final song!

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:38.330
Aquarion's true melody, come forth from nothing!

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:42.060
The song of all beginnings!

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:55.240
To live is to engrave your life.

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.070
To hammer the melody of your life into the world.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:01.830
I will open your path.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:14.980
I would never have imagined this was possible...

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:19.540
That I could play out my life to help someone...

00:17:22.230 --> 00:18:03.100
Shrade!

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:11.740
Did you hear it?

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:15.180
My song...

00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:31.960
What's wrong, Cayenne?

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:34.090
Nothing...

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:36.360
I don't know why, but...

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:41.890
I know just how you feel right now.

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:48.370
Legends are written using spilled blood as ink.

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:49.750
No...

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:54.160
Another page of the next legend has just been written.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.600
Amata?

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:11.900
Amata, where are you?

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:15.710
Amata!

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:20.090
I've been waiting for this moment.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:24.850
You...

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:37.360
Good girl.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:20:00.220
A physical body is such a wonderful thing.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.720
Wait! That's not my voice!

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:06.400
Did you take my body?

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:10.040
You will make a fine vessel.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:14.050
At last, I can realize my dream.

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:17.150
Give me back my body!

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:19.740
You have to keep your promise.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:21.820
You...

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:25.940
My name is Mikage.

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:28.540
My domain is the shadows of love.

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:31.000
You should be grateful.

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:35.830
It is a rare gift for a Wingless to host an Angel.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:46.740
Reverse!

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:54.730
You can't run anymore, Kagura.

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:58.230
Surrender and hand over the true Eve.

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:03.860
Damn you, Izumo! You're not getting my wench!

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:06.150
This is my smelly wench and no one else's!

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:07.740
Mikono!

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:10.800
Zessica!

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:12.380
I figured it out!

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:18.000
This planet's leader is crazy! We have to beat him or the fighting will never stop!

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:19.260
Zessica?

00:21:19.260 --> 00:21:23.760
Call the Wings of the Sun: the Solar Aquarion!

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.760
Who, me?

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:29.500
You have Apollo's soul! You can do it!

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:32.680
You can do it...

00:21:36.160 --> 00:21:40.570
Aquarion!

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:57.330
It actually came!

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:23.830
The Wings of the Sun!

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:26.860
You dare oppose me?

00:22:30.850 --> 00:22:35.250
Now, let's begin telling...

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:38.520
a real legend.

00:24:11.040 --> 00:24:12.910
All you have to do is close your eyes

00:24:12.910 --> 00:24:15.850
to go back to a warm, peaceful morning.

00:24:16.200 --> 00:24:20.170
But I have to keep my eyes open.

00:24:20.170 --> 00:24:24.100
Life may be a struggle, but I'm holding onto mine.
